<HEAD>§ 1010.100 General definitions.</HEAD>
<XREF ID="20240904" REFID="62" AMDINSN="2">Link to an amendment published at 89 FR 72274, Sept. 4, 2024.</XREF>
<XREF ID="20260102" REFID="43a">This amendment was delayed until Jan. 1, 2028, at 91 FR 36, Jan. 2, 2026.</XREF>
<P>When used in this chapter and in forms prescribed under this chapter, terms shall have the meanings ascribed in this subpart.</P>
<P>(a) <I>Accept.</I> A receiving financial institution, other than the recipient's financial institution, accepts a transmittal order by executing the transmittal order.</P>
<NOTE>
<HED>Note to paragraph (<E T="01">d</E>):</HED>
<P>The number of individuals may vary.</P>
</NOTE>
